description: Never add Cursor co-author or attribution trailers to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git Commits — No Cursor Attribution

Never add commit message trailers or footers such as:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor` / `Made with Cursor`
- Any similar tool or vendor attribution

This applies to all commits, amend operations, and commit messages suggested to the user.

When committing via git, use only the commit subject and body the user requested — nothing else in the message.
